  "summary": {
    "text": "GPT-6 Luna is the Luna tier of OpenAI's GPT-6 family, a reasoning language model for text and image input that the API docs describe as meant for focused, high-volume tasks. It was released with GPT-6 Sol on 22 September 2026 in the API, Amazon Bedrock, ChatGPT Work and Codex, where Free and Go users can use it in the desktop app, but not in ChatGPT conversations.",
