  "notes": "Released together with GPT-6 Sol; the GPT-6 Astra system card calls GPT-6 Luna OpenAI’s fastest and most cost-efficient model yet. In ChatGPT it is available in ChatGPT Work and Codex, not in Chat; Free and Go users can use it in the desktop app. The launch page shows no publication date; Sep 22, 2026 comes from the API changelog and other OpenAI pages. The openai.com post was read through a Wayback Machine capture."
